  partName: Fuel Injector (3)
  description: The Fuel Injector (3) is a third fuel injector positioned at the top-center-center
    of the engine, responsible for providing a balanced fuel supply to the engine's
    cylinders. Constructed from Material.002, this tiny, elongated part is crucial
    for maintaining optimal engine performance, and its precise positioning allows
    for efficient fuel metering. Notably, the fuel injector's elongated shape enables
    it to be positioned close to the intake valves for improved fuel atomization
    and reduced emissions.
